    {
      "number": "181",
      "text": "181. \u753b\u7ec6\u7ebf\u6761\u8868\u793a\u7531\u4e0b\u5217\u4e0d\u7b49\u5f0f\u7ec4\u7ed9\u51fa\u7684\u5750\u6807\u5e73\u9762\u4e0a\u70b9\u7684\u96c6\u5408\u3002\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y>x,\\\\y<2x,\\\\y<4;\\end{array}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y-x<2,\\\\y+x>4,\\\\x-4<0;\\end{array}\\right.$\nc) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+y\\leqslant6,\\\\2x+2y\\geqslant7,\\\\x\\geqslant0;\\end{array}\\right.$\nd) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x-y\\geqslant3,\\\\x+y\\leqslant5,\\\\y\\geqslant1;\\end{array}\\right.$\ne) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}|x|\\leqslant2,\\\\|y|\\leqslant3;\\end{array}\\right.$\nf) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}|x|\\leqslant4,\\\\|y|\\geqslant5.\\end{array}\\right.$",
